\fs24 \cf0 JOIN
\f1\b0  combines rows from multiple tables using a common key.\
Key concept: 
\f0\b foreign key
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 Foreign key = column referencing another table's primary key.\
Here:\
Orders.customer_id 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Customers.customer_id\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
