\f1\b0 .\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
implement these as well in short Self Join Aggregation filtering Duplicate detection Top N per group Ranking Window functions Running totals Gap and island problems Hierarchical queries Recursive CTE Subquery filtering Conditional aggregation Pivot queries Anti joins Data deduplication\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Below are the 
\f0\b common SQL interview patterns
\f1\b0  implemented 
\f0\b using your same tables
